  attackName: Launcher
  domain: 0
  isLauncher: 1
  cooldownFrames: 0
  artworkNotes: Grounded uppercut. Eight poses over 26 combat frames; load 0-5, explosive extension 6-7, maximum impact 8-12, follow-through 13-16, recover 17-21, exact Idle return 22-25. Art stays grounded. Original hit window, damage, physics and jump-cancel rules retained.
